<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome Sent - DT1 Logistics</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: #f5f7fa; padding: 20px; }
    .box { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); text-align: center; }
    h1 { color: #1B365D; }
    a { color: #1B365D; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>Welcome Email Queued</h1>
    <p>A Driver Portal welcome message has been prepared for <strong><%= driver.name %></strong> (<%= driver.email %>).</p>
    <p>It will be sent from Logan, DT1 Operations Manager, and includes the username and temporary password.</p>
    <p><a href="/drivers">← Back to Drivers</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
